Bundle-Description: JmDNS is a Java implementation of multi-cast DNS a
 nd can be used for service registration and discovery in local area n
 etworks. JmDNS is fully compatible with Apple's Bonjour.The project w
 as originally started in December 2002 by Arthur van Hoff at Strangeb
 erry. In November 2003 the project was moved to SourceForge, and the 
 name was changed from JRendezvous to JmDNS for legal reasons.Many tha
 nks to Stuart Cheshire for help and moral support.
